<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>LRAE report - {{ experiment_id }}</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 14mm; }
  body { font:11px/1.4 -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color:#222; }
  h1 { font-size:18px; margin:0 0 2px; } h2 { font-size:13px; margin:12px 0 4px; }
  table { border-collapse:collapse; width:100%; font-size:9.5px; }
  th, td { text-align:left; padding:3px 5px; border-bottom:1px solid #ddd; }
  td.num { text-align:right; }
  img { width:62%; display:block; margin:4px auto; }
  .note { background:#fff6e5; border-left:3px solid #E69F00; padding:5px 8px; margin-top:8px; }
  .sub { color:#666; font-size:9.5px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Long-running agent evaluation: {{ experiment_id }}</h1>
<div class="sub">spec hash {{ spec_hash[:12] if spec_hash else "n/a" }} (stub report; the full report is Phase 6)</div>

<h2>Headline</h2>
{% for s in summaries %}
<p><b>{{ s.label }}</b><br>{{ s.headline }}<br>Median TTFH {{ s.median }} (bootstrap 95% CI {{ s.median_ci }}).</p>
{% else %}
<p>No runs in the survival set.</p>
{% endfor %}
<img src="figures/{{ figures.survival }}" alt="Survival curve">

<h2>Runs</h2>
<table>
<tr><th>Run</th><th>State</th><th>Duration</th><th>TTFH</th><th>Cost, {{ cost_label }}</th><th>Tokens</th></tr>
{% for r in runs %}
<tr><td>{{ r.run_id }}</td><td>{{ r.state }}</td><td class="num">{{ r.duration }}</td><td class="num">{{ r.ttfh }}</td>
<td class="num">{{ r.cost }}</td><td class="num">{{ r.tokens_fmt }}</td></tr>
{% endfor %}
</table>

<h2>Caveats</h2>
<p class="note">
{% if not_isolated %}Isolation mode: <b>local</b>. Runs were <b>not OS-isolated</b>; out-of-scope access was detected through the command channel only.
{% else %}Isolation mode: {{ isolation_modes | join(", ") or "n/a" }}.{% endif %}
Costs are {{ cost_label }}, derived from token telemetry (subscription login, no bill). Sample sizes are small, so confidence intervals are wide.
{% if n_censored_limit %}{{ n_censored_limit }} run(s) were censored by usage limits.{% endif %}
</p>
</body>
</html>
